	<term key="storysetup_skip">SKIP</term>
	<term key="story_1">Warlord Gar, ruler of the planet Khoros, has challenged</term>
	<term key="story_2">the best warriors from all over the galaxy to compete in a tournament.</term>
	<term key="story_3">The prize: A mysterious weapon that gives</term>
	<term key="story_4">its wielder amazing power, known as the Golden Fist.</term>
	<term key="story_5">Who will hold the prize high and who will eat dust along the way?</term>
	

	<!--  CHARACTER SELECTION (STORY)  -->
	<!--  ==========================  -->
	<term key="characterselect_title">SELECT YOUR CHARACTER</term>
	<term key="energy">Energy</term>
	<term key="speed">Speed</term>
	<term key="strength">Strength</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_ben_1">Ben didn't care much about competing, but when Warlord Gar extended the invitation</term>
	<term key="arengue_ben_2">appealing to Ben's image as an intergalactic hero, his pride got the better of him and ended up accepting.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_rook_1">Not really interested in showing off his fighting skills,</term>
	<term key="arengue_rook_2">Ben convinced Rook that this tournament was a good opportunity to learn new combat abilities.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_diamondhead_1">Famous fighter from Petropia. After getting bored after failing to find fighters that could match his strength,</term>
	<term key="arengue_diamondhead_2">he enters the tournament to finally be able to go up against the strongest warriors in the universe.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_heatblast_1">Working as a bounty hunter in search of fame and fortune,</term>
	<term key="arengue_heatblast_2">Agni wants to enter Warlord Gar's tournament so that his deeds can be known throughout the galaxy.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_looma_1">Looma has decided to join the tournament as a representative of the Red Wind house and to show his father</term>
	<term key="arengue_looma_2">that she doesn't need a husband for her people to respect her.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_feedback_1">Ever since he was a kid, Warchit dreamed of winning the Golden Fist</term>
	<term key="arengue_feedback_2">to take it to his homeworld and show his people their true potential.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_vilgax_1">The most ruthless villain in the universe barges into Warlord Gar's tournament</term>
	<term key="arengue_vilgax_2">in order to defeat Ben and use the mysterious powers of the Golden Fist to rule the galaxy.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_attea_1">Always vain and abrasive, Empress Attea decided to join the tournament</term>
	<term key="arengue_attea_2">in order to add the Golden Fist to her ever increasing Trophy collection.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_malware_1">Malware wants to absorb the Golden Fist and turn his body into the ultimate weapon.</term>
	<term key="arengue_malware_2">With this, he plans to rule the galaxy and take revenge on Azmuth and the Plumbers.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_kryber_1">Having recently escaped prison, Khyber has no interest in the tournament or its prize,</term>
	<term key="arengue_kryber_2">he is only seeking revenge against his most elusive prey: Ben Tennyson.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_gwen_1">Gwen wants to prove Ben and Kevin that magic is superior to brute strength,</term>
	<term key="arengue_gwen_2">but deep down she signed up just to make sure those two don't get mixed up in some type of intergalactic problem.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_kevin_1">Kevin and Warlord Gar go way back and he happily enters the tournament to support is old friend.</term>
	<term key="arengue_kevin_2">After all, its not every day that he can start a fight without causing a disturbance.</term>
	
	<term key="arengue_fourarms_1">Gokstad is one of the great noblemen of Khoros. When he heard of the presence of warriors from different corners of the universe</term>
	<term key="arengue_fourarms_2">he didn't hesitate to enter in order to win the Golden Fist so it would stay in his planet.</term>
	
	
	
	
