		<term key="final_fight_diamondhead_win">For the glory of Petropia!</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_diamondhead_lose">You're nothing but a piece of talking stone!</term> <!--  habla siempre el enemigo, en este caso vilgax -->
		
		
		<term key="final_heatblast_1_heatblast">Be careful, I'm on a hot-streak and I don't want to burn you too badly</term>
