		<term key="final_fight_heatblast_win">Didn't your mom ever teach not to play with fire?</term> 
	    <term key="final_fight_heatblast_lose">This trophy will look great with the rest of my collection</term> 
		
		
	    <term key="final_looma_1_looma">I won't let your evil presence ruin my father's Tournament</term>
	    <term key="final_looma_2_vilgax">You really think you can beat the conqueror of the universe?</term>
     	<term key="final_looma_3_looma">Princess Looma of the Royal House Red Wind will put you in your place</term>
	    <term key="final_looma_4_vilgax">Try it, foolish child</term>
    
		<term key="final_fight_looma_win">That's what happens when you face the fury of the Royal House of Red Wind</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_looma_lose">After I deal with Tennyson, I'll conquer Khoros</term>
		
		<term key="final_feedback_1_feedback">With my power and the Golden Fist</term>
	    <term key="final_feedback_2_feedback">I'll be unstoppable, so get out of my way Malware</term>
	    <term key="final_feedback_3_malware">Your poor brain does not understand</term>
     	<term key="final_feedback_4_malware">the capabilities of the Golden Fist, you don't deserve it</term>
		<term key="final_feedback_5_feedback">There is only one way to solve this</term>
	    <term key="final_feedback_6_malware">That's right, assimilating you and the Golden Fist!</term>
		
		
		<term key="final_fight_feedback_win">Fast as lightining and powerful as thunder, I'm the best!</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_feedback_lose">I'm one step closer to being perfect</term>
		
		
		<term key="final_rook_1_rook">In the name of galactic justice and the Plumbers,</term>
	    <term key="final_rook_2_rook">I ordered you to stop!</term>
	    <term key="final_rook_3_malware">Your warnings mean nothing to me!</term>
     	<term key="final_rook_4_rook">You leave me no choice but to take you down by force</term>
		<term key="final_rook_5_malware">You are crazy if you think that a simple Plumber can stop me</term>
		
		<term key="final_rook_win">It is important for universal peace that you're locked away</term>
	    <term key="final_rook_lose">With this you should understand that you are no match for me</term>
		
		
		
	    <term key="final_vilgax_1_vilgax">Tennyson! It's time to defeat you once and for all...</term>
	    <term key="final_vilgax_2_ben">I've been defeating you since I was 10,</term>
	    <term key="final_vilgax_3_ben">I doubt you have what it takes to do it!</term>
     	<term key="final_vilgax_4_vilgax">This time I'll destroy you!</term>
		<term key="final_vilgax_5_ben">Omnitrix do not fail me now, it's Hero time!</term>
		
		<term key="final_fight_vilgax_win">Finally you are mine Tennyson!</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_vilgax_lose">I always end up kicking your butt!</term>
		
		
		
		<term key="final_attea_1_attea">You can`t defeat the Empress of the Incrusian Army</term>
	    <term key="final_attea_2_kryber">You're the prey I was looking for</term>
	    <term key="final_attea_3_attea">I'll show you what Incursians are made of</term>
     	<term key="final_attea_4_kryber">The hunt begins now</term>
	
		
		<term key="final_fight_attea_win">The Incursians show no mercy!</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_attea_lose">Nobody messes with Khyber the hunter</term>
			
			
					
		<term key="final_malware_1_malware">Ben Tennyson, the bane of my existance</term>
	    <term key="final_malware_2_ben">This time I'll make sure you stay out of commision</term>
	    <term key="final_malware_3_malware">I would love to see you try</term>
     	<term key="final_malware_4_ben">It`s Hero Time!</term>
	
		
		<term key="final_fight_malware_win">Finally, I`ve become the ultimate weapon</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_malware_lose">I`m a Super Hero!</term>
		
		
		
		<term key="final_kryber_1_kryber">Tennyson, now you have no place to hide</term>
	    <term key="final_kryber_2_ben">Hide? A hero never escapes from danger</term>
	    <term key="final_kryber_3_kryber">The Omnitrix will be a great addition to my collection</term>
     	<term key="final_kryber_4_ben">You have no chance of defeating me</term>
	
		
		<term key="final_fight_kryber_win">With the Omnitrix, my collection is unique</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_kryber_lose">You should really consider another profession!</term>
		
		
		<term key="final_gwen_1_gwen">I will not let you absorb the Golden Fist</term>
