	    <term key="final_kevin_3_kryber">That animal no longer served my plans,</term>
     	<term key="final_kevin_4_kryber">I'll deal with her later</term>
	    <term key="final_kevin_5_kevin">She no longer has anything to do with you</term>
		<term key="final_kevin_6_kevin">and I'll make sure you don`t hurt her</term>
		<term key="final_kevin_7_kryber">Let`s see if your skills can back up your words!</term>
		 
