	    <term key="final_fight_kevin_lose">The hunt is over!</term>
		
		
		
		<term key="final_fourarms_1_fourarms">I won't let you take Lord Gar's Golden Fist</term>
	    <term key="final_fourarms_2_vilgax">Out of my way, you're no rival for me</term>
     	<term key="final_fourarms_3_fourarms">I'll show you the strength of the Tetramands</term>
	    <term key="final_fourarms_4_vilgax">Don't make me laugh</term>
    
		<term key="final_fight_fourarms_win">Feel the power Khoros' fists</term>
	    <term key="final_fight_fourarms_lose">After dealing with Tennyson, I'll take care of Khoros</term>
		
		
		
			<!--  STORY END - FINAL  -->
	        <!--  ===================  -->
			
	
			<term key="story_end_diamondhead_1">After defeating Vilgax and getting the Golden Fist, Kruos made the Petrosapiens famous for being formidable warriors.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_diamondhead_2">Thanks to this, Petropia became a meeting point for warriors across the galaxy.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_heatblast_1">By winning the Golden Fist, Agni's fire burned brighter than ever before.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_heatblast_2">With this new pride, he traveled the galaxy in search of new and stronger opponents.</term>
									
			<term key="story_end_looma_1">Looma not only proved to be the best warrior in Khoros but also in the entire galaxy.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_looma_2">Her family and her people look up to their princess with pride and admiration.</term>
		
			<term key="story_end_feedback_1">Now that Warchit fulfilled his dream, he decided to open a fight school in his planet</term>
		    <term key="story_end_feedback_2">in order to train the best warriors in the galaxy.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_rook_1">The most important thing to Rook is to have shown that the plumbers fighting style</term>
		    <term key="story_end_rook_2">is the most complete of the universe.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_vilgax_1">Despite having beaten Ben, Vilgax was defeated by Gwen, and Kevin Rook before he could take the Omnitrix.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_vilgax_2">In the midst of the battle, Vilgax escaped with the Golden Fist.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_attea_1">Attea showed the universe the power of the Incursians</term>
		    <term key="story_end_attea_2">and added the "Golden Fist" to her large collection of personal trophies.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_malware_1">Malware was able to merge his body with the powerful "Golden Fist".</term>
		    <term key="story_end_malware_2">Although he reached unimaginable power, he could not defeat all the heroes of the galaxy together.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_kryber_1">Khyber didn't count on Kevin, Gwen and Rook joining forces to help Ben in the final battle.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_kryber_2">Using his refined hunter instincts, he managed to generate a distraction and escape.</term>
		
			<term key="story_end_gwen_1">With the Golden Fist in her hands, Gwen proved that magic and intelligence</term>
		    <term key="story_end_gwen_2">are the most powerful weapons in the universe.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_kevin_1">Kevin handed the Golden Fist to Lord Gar in gratitude for having been so kind to him in the past.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_kevin_2">Khoros will always remember his gesture with sympathy and happiness.</term>
			
			<term key="story_end_ben_1">Once again Ben saved the universe from the clutches of Vilgax and was crowned champion of the tournament.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_ben_2">The people of Khoros cheered his name so Ben was happy to have been part of this great adventure.</term>
		
			<term key="story_end_fourarms_1">Gokstad proudly lifted the Golden Fist in front of the people of Khoros.</term>
		    <term key="story_end_fourarms_2">Lord Gar pointed out that Gokstad's fights were some of the most admirable battles he had ever witnessed.</term>
		
		
	
	
